{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0a1b2c3d4e5f6789",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/agent_os/DELIVERABLE_SWARM_OPERATING_OVERVIEW.md",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a2b3c4d5e6f7890",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Einstieg: nutzen, wenn ein Auftrag ein konkretes Lieferobjekt erzeugen muss.\n\nBeispiele: Research-Brief, Datenchart, Dokument, Deck, Bild, Video, Operator-Notiz, Multi-Lane-Paket.",
      "x": -620,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a3b4c5d6e7f8901",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Nicht als Runtime-Erlaubnis nutzen.\n\nKeine OpenSwarm-Installation. Keine Auto-Installation. Kein Composio-Full-Mesh. Kein Secret-Import. Keine oeffentliche Veroeffentlichung. Keine Hintergrundautomation.",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a4b5c6d7e8f9012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Orchestrator\n\nKlassifiziert Scope, waehlt Lanes, bindet den Output-Vertrag und verhindert versteckte all-to-all-Handoffs.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a5b6c7d8e9f0123",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Lane-Matrix\n\nassistant, research, data, docs, slides, images, video.\n\nJede Lane hat Owner, Trigger, erlaubte Toolsets, Artefakttypen, Verifier, Risikoklasse und Gate.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a6b7c8d9e0f1234",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Output-Vertrag\n\nartifact_id\nlane_id\nartifact_type\noutput_path\nstatus\nverifier\nblocked_gates\nnext_action",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b8c9d0e1f2345",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Verifier + Gate\n\nLokaler Verifier beweist nutzbaren Output. Operator-/Provider-Gate stoppt irreversible, Media-, Konto-, Hintergrund- oder Publish-Aktionen.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a8b9c0d1e2f3456",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Finaler Zustand\n\nverified: Artefaktpfad + Verifier-Evidence\nblocked: fehlender Input oder Gate + naechste sichere Aktion\n\nDauerhafte Wahrheit geht nach Obsidian. Repo-Wahrheit geht ueber Commit/Push/CI.",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a9b0c1d2e3f4567",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "research_agent/ops/deliverable_swarm.py",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a0b1c2d3e4f5678",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "outputs/agent_os_readiness/DELIVERABLE_SWARM_CONTRACT.md",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b1c2d3e4f5a6789",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/agent_os/DELIVERABLE_SWARM_CONTRACT.md",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b2c3d4e5f6a7890",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Befehl\n\npython3 scripts/ops/agent_os_readiness.py\n\nRegeneriert Lane-Matrix, Output-Vertraege, Readiness-Bericht, Operator Inbox und Automation Cards.",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b3c4d5e6f7a8901",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Tests\n\npytest\ncoverage\nruff\ngit diff --check\nJSON-Parse\nGitHub CI",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
